      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استحرّ</span></b>  (S, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرَّ</span></b>  (S, TA) (tropical:)  <i>It</i>
(slaughter) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, vehement,</i> (S, K,)
<i>and great in extent;</i> (TA;) and the same is said
of death. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استحرّها</span> <i>He asked,</i> or <i>desired, of her</i> [<i>that she should make what is
termed</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرِيرَة</span>. (A.) [See 1, last signification.]

